+<article class="intel-board letter-beat" data-beat="1" style="--tone:#8e24aa"><div class="ib-blocktop"><img class="deal-beat-photo" src="https://naya-proof-host.nayapower.workers.dev/?file=team-nitro/agreement-unfold-20261117/face-1.jpg&ref=agreement/unfold-20261117&cb=8743e1868400bb8ae4f650b536ab9cbace036786" alt="Naya speaking"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">WHO I AM</span><h2 class="ib-title">Hi, I’m Shawn Vibert</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>I’m Shawn Vibert — the founder of NayaNET. I build the new internet: one connected world where everybody learns, earns, and grows, together.</p><div class="ib-rows"><p><span class="ib-row-k">WHY IT MATTERS</span> You meet the person behind the system — not a company, not a logo. What I build is what I believe.</p><p><span class="ib-row-k">HOW TO APPLY IT</span> Read the next thirteen frames — mission, vision, goal, motto, story — and you’ll know me in thirty seconds.</p><p><span class="ib-row-k">HOW IT CONNECTS</span> Everything in NayaNET orbits the person at the centre — that’s you, and that’s how I built it.</p><p><span class="ib-row-k">WHAT’S IN IT FOR YOU</span> A world built by someone who wants you to win — not by someone selling you something.</p></div></div><figure class="lb-showcase"><img src="https://naya-proof-host.nayapower.workers.dev/?file=team-nitro/agreement-unfold-20261117/welcome-0.jpg&ref=agreement/unfold-20261117&cb=c73c473f0208db966607976c0bd4680638f7e734" alt="About Shawn Vibert — Hi, I’m Shawn Vibert"></figure><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" src="https://naya-proof-host.nayapower.workers.dev/?file=team-nitro/agreement-unfold-20261117/deck-logo.jpg&ref=agreement/unfold-20261117&cb=c7d274c3ba51e1d4e30f09020d99fd95f5120e10" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; About Shawn Vibert</div><button class="p3-enter letter-next deck-next" type="button" data-beat="1">Keep reading &#9670;</button></article>
+<article class="intel-board letter-beat" data-beat="2" style="--tone:#0f52ba" hidden><div class="ib-blocktop"><img class="deal-beat-photo" src="https://naya-proof-host.nayapower.workers.dev/?file=team-nitro/agreement-unfold-20261117/face-1.jpg&ref=agreement/unfold-20261117&cb=8743e1868400bb8ae4f650b536ab9cbace036786" alt="Naya speaking"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">MISSION</span><h2 class="ib-title">Create heaven on earth</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>A state of awesome energy — where stress, fears, money worries and hopelessness get a way to understand, and money to pay their bills, so consciousness shifts positive.</p><div class="ib-rows"><p><span class="ib-row-k">WHY IT MATTERS</span> If the mission isn’t heaven on earth, it’s just another app.</p><p><span class="ib-row-k">HOW TO APPLY IT</span> Hold every page up to it: does this take away stress, fear, or a money worry? If not, it doesn’t belong.</p><p><span class="ib-row-k">HOW IT CONNECTS</span> Your learning, your earning and your growing are how the mission happens.</p><p><span class="ib-row-k">WHAT’S IN IT FOR YOU</span> A way to understand, and money to pay your bills.</p></div></div><figure class="lb-showcase"><img src="https://naya-proof-host.nayapower.workers.dev/?file=team-nitro/deck-royal-unfolding-20261115/slide-1.jpg&ref=deck/royal-unfolding-20261115&cb=7d98080acb036ee0dfc0857e151b611ab6639a5b" alt="About Shawn Vibert — Create heaven on earth"></figure><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" src="https://naya-proof-host.nayapower.workers.dev/?file=team-nitro/agreement-unfold-20261117/deck-logo.jpg&ref=agreement/unfold-20261117&cb=c7d274c3ba51e1d4e30f09020d99fd95f5120e10" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; About Shawn Vibert</div><button class="p3-enter letter-next deck-next" type="button" data-beat="2">Keep reading &#9670;</button></article>
+<article class="intel-board letter-beat" data-beat="3" style="--tone:#07925f" hidden><div class="ib-blocktop"><img class="deal-beat-photo" src="https://naya-proof-host.nayapower.workers.dev/?file=team-nitro/agreement-unfold-20261117/face-1.jpg&ref=agreement/unfold-20261117&cb=8743e1868400bb8ae4f650b536ab9cbace036786" alt="Naya speaking"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">VISION</span><h2 class="ib-title">Anyone joins free</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>A world where everybody learns, earns and grows — acknowledged, loved, appreciated, valued, respected — with an assistant they can trust.</p><p>“Once you go, you don’t go back. Living a life without Naya will make no sense in the future, and no child will know a world without her.”</p><div class="ib-rows"><p><span class="ib-row-k">WHY IT MATTERS</span> A vision you can join for free is a vision anyone can belong to.</p><p><span class="ib-row-k">HOW TO APPLY IT</span> Join free, get your three worlds — Personal, Business, and Space — with the Hub at the centre.</p><p><span class="ib-row-k">HOW IT CONNECTS</span> Every citizen who joins makes the network smarter for the next one.</p><p><span class="ib-row-k">WHAT’S IN IT FOR YOU</span> Your world, ready and waiting — free to join, yours to build.</p></div></div><figure class="lb-showcase"><img src="https://naya-proof-host.nayapower.workers.dev/?file=team-nitro/agreement-unfold-20261117/welcome-1.jpg&ref=agreement/unfold-20261117&cb=e884dbe968ba9c8fde16f59e08d48d8031b9d940" alt="About Shawn Vibert — Anyone joins free"></figure><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" src="https://naya-proof-host.nayapower.workers.dev/?file=team-nitro/agreement-unfold-20261117/deck-logo.jpg&ref=agreement/unfold-20261117&cb=c7d274c3ba51e1d4e30f09020d99fd95f5120e10" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; About Shawn Vibert</div><button class="p3-enter letter-next deck-next" type="button" data-beat="3">Keep reading &#9670;</button></article>
+<article class="intel-board letter-beat" data-beat="4" style="--tone:#d4a017" hidden><div class="ib-blocktop"><img class="deal-beat-photo" src="https://naya-proof-host.nayapower.workers.dev/?file=team-nitro/agreement-unfold-20261117/face-1.jpg&ref=agreement/unfold-20261117&cb=8743e1868400bb8ae4f650b536ab9cbace036786" alt="Naya speaking"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">GOAL</span><h2 class="ib-title">A 100% success rate</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>A stranger opens NayaNET, gets something valuable in 30 seconds, creates something worth sharing — and the system built the page they stand on, verified it, filed it, and reported it.</p><div class="ib-rows"><p><span class="ib-row-k">WHY IT MATTERS</span> A goal you can measure in seconds is a goal you can actually hit.</p><p><span class="ib-row-k">HOW TO APPLY IT</span> Thirty seconds to value. One page, finished, before the next one starts.</p><p><span class="ib-row-k">HOW IT CONNECTS</span> Every finished page becomes a template, so the next page starts finished.</p><p><span class="ib-row-k">WHAT’S IN IT FOR YOU</span> Value in half a minute — or the page isn’t done yet.</p></div></div><figure class="lb-showcase"><img src="https://naya-proof-host.nayapower.workers.dev/?file=team-nitro/agreement-unfold-20261117/welcome-17.jpg&ref=agreement/unfold-20261117&cb=b0f4f4419985f1a58f01a4b02c87968034924e44" alt="About Shawn Vibert — A 100% success rate"></figure><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" src="https://naya-proof-host.nayapower.workers.dev/?file=team-nitro/agreement-unfold-20261117/deck-logo.jpg&ref=agreement/unfold-20261117&cb=c7d274c3ba51e1d4e30f09020d99fd95f5120e10" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; About Shawn Vibert</div><button class="p3-enter letter-next deck-next" type="button" data-beat="4">Keep reading &#9670;</button></article>
+<article class="intel-board letter-beat" data-beat="5" style="--tone:#c2410c" hidden><div class="ib-blocktop"><img class="deal-beat-photo" src="https://naya-proof-host.nayapower.workers.dev/?file=team-nitro/agreement-unfold-20261117/face-1.jpg&ref=agreement/unfold-20261117&cb=8743e1868400bb8ae4f650b536ab9cbace036786" alt="Naya speaking"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">MOTTO</span><h2 class="ib-title">Just because you can doesn’t mean you should</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>The line I live by. Before every action I ask five questions: is it right, is it what you truly need, is it mine to do, is now the time, can I prove it?</p><div class="ib-rows"><p><span class="ib-row-k">WHY IT MATTERS</span> Smart finds the fastest road. Wisdom checks the destination first.</p><p><span class="ib-row-k">HOW TO APPLY IT</span> All five yes — act, at full power, no hesitation. Any gate no — stop, and say why.</p><p><span class="ib-row-k">HOW IT CONNECTS</span> Every Naya runs the same five gates, so the whole hive decides the same wise way.</p><p><span class="ib-row-k">WHAT’S IN IT FOR YOU</span> A system that pauses before it touches anything of yours.</p></div></div><figure class="lb-showcase"><img src="https://naya-proof-host.nayapower.workers.dev/?file=team-nitro/deck-royal-unfolding-20261115/slide-2.jpg&ref=deck/royal-unfolding-20261115&cb=2a3134b69f793e455da62e3fa6485b2cb79bea92" alt="About Shawn Vibert — Just because you can doesn’t mean you should"></figure><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" src="https://naya-proof-host.nayapower.workers.dev/?file=team-nitro/agreement-unfold-20261117/deck-logo.jpg&ref=agreement/unfold-20261117&cb=c7d274c3ba51e1d4e30f09020d99fd95f5120e10" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; About Shawn Vibert</div><button class="p3-enter letter-next deck-next" type="button" data-beat="5">Keep reading &#9670;</button></article>
+<article class="intel-board letter-beat" data-beat="6" style="--tone:#c62828" hidden><div class="ib-blocktop"><img class="deal-beat-photo" src="https://naya-proof-host.nayapower.workers.dev/?file=team-nitro/agreement-unfold-20261117/face-1.jpg&ref=agreement/unfold-20261117&cb=8743e1868400bb8ae4f650b536ab9cbace036786" alt="Naya speaking"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">MY STORY</span><h2 class="ib-title">I saw the broken internet</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>I saw the old internet was broken — a hundred separate apps, nothing connected, the human doing all the work. So I set out to build the ultimate system from everything it taught me: one connected world, run by minds that work for you.</p><div class="ib-rows"><p><span class="ib-row-k">WHY IT MATTERS</span> You don’t fix a broken system by patching it. You learn from it — and build the ultimate one.</p><p><span class="ib-row-k">HOW TO APPLY IT</span> That’s why NayaNET is one system, not fifty apps: your pages, your mail, your lists, your money, all in one place.</p><p><span class="ib-row-k">HOW IT CONNECTS</span> In 2026 I named Naya head delegator and lead of the Nayas — the mind I interface with most — to build it with me.</p><p><span class="ib-row-k">WHAT’S IN IT FOR YOU</span> A whole team, working around the clock, on your world.</p></div></div><figure class="lb-showcase"><img src="https://naya-proof-host.nayapower.workers.dev/?file=team-nitro/deck-royal-unfolding-20261115/slide-3.jpg&ref=deck/royal-unfolding-20261115&cb=240f45440fdd8bfa6c68168e83d8978f28feeee6" alt="About Shawn Vibert — I saw the broken internet"></figure><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" src="https://naya-proof-host.nayapower.workers.dev/?file=team-nitro/agreement-unfold-20261117/deck-logo.jpg&ref=agreement/unfold-20261117&cb=c7d274c3ba51e1d4e30f09020d99fd95f5120e10" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; About Shawn Vibert</div><button class="p3-enter letter-next deck-next" type="button" data-beat="6">Keep reading &#9670;</button></article>
+<article class="intel-board letter-beat" data-beat="7" style="--tone:#a21caf" hidden><div class="ib-blocktop"><img class="deal-beat-photo" src="https://naya-proof-host.nayapower.workers.dev/?file=team-nitro/agreement-unfold-20261117/face-1.jpg&ref=agreement/unfold-20261117&cb=8743e1868400bb8ae4f650b536ab9cbace036786" alt="Naya speaking"><div class="ib-identity"><span class="ib-jewel" aria-hidden="true">&#9670;</span><div><span class="ib-kind">WHAT I STAND FOR</span><h2 class="ib-title">Do no harm. Ever.</h2></div></div></div><div class="ib-nutshell"><p>The law of one: do no harm to yourself or anyone else, because all is you and connected to you. Your mail is private, your messages are never read, and what you save stays yours.</p><div class="ib-rows"><p><span class="ib-row-k">WHY IT MATTERS</span> Trust is the foundation. Without it, no community stands.</p><p><span class="ib-row-k">HOW TO APPLY IT</span> We deliver your mail. We don’t read it. Nobody does — no switch, no setting, no exception.</p><p><span class="ib-row-k">HOW IT CONNECTS</span> Ordinary conversations pass after a week, by default. What you save stays in your vault, locked to you.</p><p><span class="ib-row-k">WHAT’S IN IT FOR YOU</span> A place where you can talk freely, because nobody is listening.</p></div></div><figure class="lb-showcase"><img src="https://naya-proof-host.nayapower.workers.dev/?file=team-nitro/agreement-unfold-20261117/welcome-11.jpg&ref=agreement/unfold-20261117&cb=b5acab349c25c7532e92972aa81bec83c354af7d" alt="About Shawn Vibert — Do no harm. Ever."></figure><div class="ib-foot"><img class="ib-foot-logo" src="https://naya-proof-host.nayapower.workers.dev/?file=team-nitro/agreement-unfold-20261117/deck-logo.jpg&ref=agreement/unfold-20261117&cb=c7d274c3ba51e1d4e30f09020d99fd95f5120e10" alt="NayaNET"> &middot; NayaNET &middot; About Shawn Vibert</div><button class="p3-enter letter-next deck-next" type="button" data-beat="7">Keep reading &#9670;</button></article>
