pan class="orb ib-card-orb ult-orb" style="--oc:#8e24aa;--oc-rgb:142,36,170" aria-hidden="true"><i class="orb-ring" aria-hidden="true"><i class="orb-dot"></i></i></span><span>The same door everywhere, on every page, for every membership — learn it once, never get lost.</span></li></ul></div><div class="ult-part ult-part-nut" tabindex="0"><div class="ult-part-head"><span class="os-jewel os-jewel-md ult-jewel" style="--jc:#8e24aa" aria-hidden="true">★</span><p class="ult-part-label"><strong>One real example:</strong></p></div><ul class="ult-bul"><li><span class="orb ib-card-orb ult-orb" style="--oc:#8e24aa;--oc-rgb:142,36,170" aria-hidden="true"><i class="orb-ring" aria-hidden="true"><i class="orb-dot"></i></i></span><span>The dial you entered through — one dial, your name, your code — is this skill, working, on nayanet.app.</span></li><li><span class="orb ib-card-orb ult-orb" style="--oc:#8e24aa;--oc-rgb:142,36,170" aria-hidden="true"><i class="orb-ring" aria-hidden="true"><i class="orb-dot"></i></i></span><span>Status: PRODUCTION-PROVEN</span></li><li><span class="orb ib-card-orb ult-orb" style="--oc:#8e24aa;--oc-rgb:142,36,170" aria-hidden="true"><i class="orb-ring" aria-hidden="true"><i class="orb-dot"></i></i></span><span><a class="skill-proof" href="https://nayanet.app/">See the door, live ◆</a></span></li><li><span class="orb ib-card-orb ult-orb" style="--oc:#8e24aa;--oc-rgb:142,36,170" aria-hidden="true"><i class="orb-ring" aria-hidden="true"><i class="orb-dot"></i></i></span><span><b>What’s in it for you:</b> You step into your private world in seconds, through a door that feels like yours.</span></li></ul></div><p class="ult-who">One dial, your name, your code — and you’re in.</p></div></article>
