 makes us different:</strong></p></div><ul class="ult-bul"><li><span class="orb ib-card-orb ult-orb" style="--oc:#6d28d9;--oc-rgb:109,40,217" aria-hidden="true"><i class="orb-ring" aria-hidden="true"><i class="orb-dot"></i></i></span><span>The gauge follows the number, never the other way around. The numbers always follow the truth.</span></li></ul></div><div class="ult-part ult-part-nut" tabindex="0"><div class="ult-part-head"><span class="os-jewel os-jewel-md ult-jewel" style="--jc:#6d28d9" aria-hidden="true">★</span><p class="ult-part-label"><strong>One real example:</strong></p></div><ul class="ult-bul"><li><span class="orb ib-card-orb ult-orb" style="--oc:#6d28d9;--oc-rgb:109,40,217" aria-hidden="true"><i class="orb-ring" aria-hidden="true"><i class="orb-dot"></i></i></span><span>The Dashboard’s gauges and orbs — the number dead centre, the gauge underneath — are this skill, live.</span></li><li><span class="orb ib-card-orb ult-orb" style="--oc:#6d28d9;--oc-rgb:109,40,217" aria-hidden="true"><i class="orb-ring" aria-hidden="true"><i class="orb-dot"></i></i></span><span>Status: PRODUCTION-PROVEN</span></li><li><span class="orb ib-card-orb ult-orb" style="--oc:#6d28d9;--oc-rgb:109,40,217" aria-hidden="true"><i class="orb-ring" aria-hidden="true"><i class="orb-dot"></i></i></span><span><a class="skill-proof" href="https://nayanet.app/dashboard">See your numbers, live ◆</a></span></li><li><span class="orb ib-card-orb ult-orb" style="--oc:#6d28d9;--oc-rgb:109,40,217" aria-hidden="true"><i class="orb-ring" aria-hidden="true"><i class="orb-dot"></i></i></span><span><b>What’s in it for you:</b> You see where you stand and decide what to do next — no guessing.</span></li></ul></div><p class="ult-who">The ledger keeps the record. The dashboard shows it back. One place, two views.</p></div></article>
